          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Meshech and Tubal are there, with the graves of their soldiers all around. They are all uncircumcised, all killed in battle. Yet once they terrified the living. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They were not given honourable burial like the heroes of ancient times,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32.27",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Some ancient translations",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "of ancient times",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; Hebrew",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "of the uncircumcised.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " who went fully armed to the world of the dead, their swords placed under their heads and their shields",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32.27",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Probable text",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "shields",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; Hebrew",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "iniquities.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " over their bodies. These heroes were once powerful enough to terrify the living.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.27"
            ]
          }
        }
